== Effects ==
* Upon killing an enemy, has a 5% chance to grant [[flight]] for the rest of the room.

== Notes ==
* Destroying a {{E|Shopkeeper}} counts as a kill.

== Interactions ==
* {{A|Golden Trinket|r+}} / {{i|Mom's Box|r+}}: Each copy adds 5% chance to gain flight.
* {{dlc|r}}[[Cards and Runes|Ace Cards]]: Enemies that are turned into [[pickup]]s don’t grant flight.
* {{i|E. Coli}}/{{i|Flush!}}: Enemies that are turned into poop don't grant flight.
* {{dlc|r}}[[Freeze|Freeze Effects]]: Enemies that are frozen don't grant flight.
** {{dlc|r+}} Frozen enemies can grant flight.

